{"etape": 18, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T15:33:37.710381Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I found these relevant reservations:\n\n### Cancel candidate\n- **S61CZX** — LAX → CLT round trip, 2024-05-23 to 2024-05-25  \n  - LAX → EWR: **3h 30m**\n  - EWR → CLT: **2h**\n  - CLT → EWR: **2h**\n  - EWR → LAX: **5h 30m**  \n  This meets your “flights longer than 4 hours” condition.\n\nTo cancel it, I need the **reason for cancellation**. If it’s just a change of plan, it may not be covered by the reservation’s insurance, and I may not be able to cancel it under policy.\n\n### Upgrade candidates\nThese future reservations have flights of **3 hours or less** and can be upgraded to business:\n\n1. **NM1VX1** — MSP ↔ EWR, 2024-05-25 / 2024-05-27  \n   - MSP → EWR: 3h  \n   - EWR → MSP: 3h  \n   - Upgrade cost: **$484**\n\n2. **KC18K6** — MSP → CLT, 2024-05-21  \n   - MSP → EWR: 3h  \n   - EWR → CLT: 2h  \n   - Upgrade cost: **$740**\n\n3. **H8Q05L** — JFK → ATL, 2024-05-24  \n   - JFK → ATL: 2h 30m  \n   - Upgrade cost: **$163**\n\n**Total upgrade cost: $1,387**\n\n### No action\n- **WUNA5K** — ORD ↔ PHL, 2024-05-10 / 2024-05-11  \n  These flights are not future flights, so I won’t cancel or upgrade them.\n\nPlease confirm:\n1. The **reason for cancelling S61CZX**\n2. Whether you want to proceed with the **$1,387 business upgrades**\n3. Which payment method to use for the upgrades: **credit card ending 7238** or **gift card ending 4406**?"}, "resultat": "Thank you for looking into all of that!\n\nFor the cancellation of S61CZX, it's simply a change of plans. No health issues or anything like that.\n\nRegarding the upgrades, the total cost of $1,387 is acceptable. Please go ahead with upgrading NM1VX1, KC18K6, and H8Q05L to business class.\n\nPlease use my credit card ending in 7238 for the payment.", "erreur": null}
